# Fact pattern — DXC CFO target bonus (FP-060), from a real SEC filing

> Using Incentive_comp_dxc_side_letter as D

## FP-060 — 135% of an $800,000 base

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestFp060:
  output computation content D.IncentiveCompDxc

scope TestFp060:
  definition computation equals
    output of D.IncentiveCompDxc with { -- annual_base_salary: $800,000 }
  assertion computation.target_bonus = $1,080,000
  assertion computation.target_bonus_rate = 135%
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope TestFp060
┌─[RESULT]─ TestFp060 ─
│ computation =
│   IncentiveCompDxc {
│     -- target_bonus_rate: 1.35
│     -- target_bonus: $1,080,000.00
│   }
└─
```
